### Internal Folder Consistency

In addition to organizing the root directory, all files inside the level folders have been renamed to follow a consistent `Level [N] - [Description]` or `Starter - [Description]` format.

- **Naming Convention Applied**:
    - **Normalization**: Underscores and hyphens replaced with spaces.
    - **Clean up**: Removed author names (e.g., Morgan Hawys), "pdfcoffee.com_", and "pdf-free".
    - **Standardized Prefixes**: Added "Level [N] - " or "Starter - " to every file and folder.
    - **Handling Alternatives**: Added "(Alt)" or numbered suffixes (e.g., "Phonics Book 1", "Phonics Book 2") where multiple versions existed.

